{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{"comments":[{"id":"ec70f05d-5ef2-4551-bd3c-aa4d4c0c077a","body":"Local handoff requested by Cooper is ready. Final pushed revision: `4fb6bc685c90c7442787fcf24a7d694b49038132` on `codex/dev-73-skill-test-boundaries`, [draft PR #99](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/99), stacked on #98. [Committed continuation prompt](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/4fb6bc685c90c7442787fcf24a7d694b49038132/docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-local-handoff.md) records scope, authority, PR stack, remaining work, precise adad dependency revision, Medicare decision and verification constraints.\n\nThis slice preserves all 21 skill-policy cases, migrates their I/O to Effect FileSystem and Schema-owned fixture ingress, and adds full strict scope/type/CLI proof. 21 skill tests, 77 lint cases, all repository tests, full verification and build passed; final docs/format checks passed after writing the prompt. PR #98 hosted Quality passed; #99 CI is newly requested, not yet verified. No dependency version, canonical skill tree or tax result changed.\n\nDEV-73 remains In Progress and DEV-74–81 remain unfinished. Cloud execution stops for the requested handoff; nothing is merged, deployed or published. Medicare correction still needs Cooper's bounded scope decision and does not block independent implementation.","attachments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-04T05:01:29.151Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-04T05:01:29.082Z","parentId":null,"resolvedAt":null,"quotedText":null,"author":{"id":"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df","name":"Cooper Corbett"},"onBehalfOf":null},{"id":"14043998-5336-4f2f-8b49-652669c588d4","body":"[Draft PR #98](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/98) is ready at `eb13b36c274b4da017acb170f4505a19caf9a156`, stacked on #97. Docs adapters/examples now pass all eleven strict rules; 75 CLI cases, 13 docs-content tests, all repository tests, frozen install, full verification and build passed. Local workerd/Chromium proof passed all 16 oracles. It exposed and fixed hard-coded historical versions in the proof harness: receipts now read installed manifests (Vite plugin 1.62.5, workerd 1.20261001.1, Wrangler 4.147.0); old receipts are preserved as history. Continuing skill-policy test migration on the next branch. DEV-73 remains In Progress and DEV-74–81 remain the subsequent goal. No merge/deployment or tax-result change.","attachments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-04T04:54:14.168Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-04T04:54:14.116Z","parentId":null,"resolvedAt":null,"quotedText":null,"author":{"id":"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df","name":"Cooper Corbett"},"onBehalfOf":null},{"id":"b65ad424-1a07-45a7-8127-d51d3dd102f5","body":"PR #97 hosted Quality passed at `3217c6c856da1c599a013d4e3de12722d710000c` ([run](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/actions/runs/37176551853)). The next docs adapter slice is implemented locally: named Effect collection operations, processed-only SDK text reads with receiver/redaction tests, immutable Shiki metadata, and checked public examples. The server example retains the documented weekly result and rejects malformed JSON, fractional cents and unsupported periods; 13 docs-content tests and package/example types pass. Full repository and local workerd verification are running before a draft PR. All three calculator outputs and the pending Medicare decision remain separate; no merge, deployment or publication. Continuing DEV-73 and then DEV-74–81 in dependency order.","attachments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-04T04:42:07.381Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-04T04:42:07.322Z","parentId":null,"resolvedAt":null,"quotedText":null,"author":{"id":"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df","name":"Cooper Corbett"},"onBehalfOf":null},{"id":"bf6858f1-9d59-4c74-a9a1-4baf94523dd8","body":"[Draft PR #97](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/97), revision `3217c6c856da1c599a013d4e3de12722d710000c`, covers functional repository-path and governance tooling. All eleven canonical rules apply; exact command runtime admissions have real CLI and configuration proof. Tests passed: 11 repository-path, 15 governance, 70 lint, full repository tests, types, verification and build. Existing canonical skill hashes and tax results remain unchanged. The provisional remaining strict inventory is 1,550 diagnostics before host/fixture qualification, not an accepted defect count. PR #96 hosted Quality passed. Continuing documentation adapter packages: immutable Shiki nodes, Effect-native generated-page work, checked serialization and validation boundaries. DEV-73 remains In Progress; no merge or deployment.","attachments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-04T04:27:50.235Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-04T04:27:50.201Z","parentId":null,"resolvedAt":null,"quotedText":null,"author":{"id":"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df","name":"Cooper Corbett"},"onBehalfOf":null},{"id":"aeb97d2f-66a8-4970-b2f1-7bb3e8f074e9","body":"[Draft PR #96](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/96), revision `b854aad61e9e8cd07c061584cd2ccbae5e85fc8b`, extends all eleven canonical rules to HTTP API and shared testing. OpenAPI/error evidence uses owning Schema codecs; snapshot I/O uses Effect FileSystem. New test type projects exposed and corrected previously unchecked branded-context and tagged-union usage. Exact Fetch-signature/adjacent-file/async-rejection CLI probes pass. Frozen install, all tests (64 lint cases, five API cases, five assertion cases), full verification and build passed. OpenAPI snapshot and retained tax results are unchanged. PR #95 hosted Quality passed. Continuing repository-path and governance test hosts; no merge, deployment or Medicare correction.","attachments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-04T03:59:11.186Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-04T03:59:11.158Z","parentId":null,"resolvedAt":null,"quotedText":null,"author":{"id":"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df","name":"Cooper Corbett"},"onBehalfOf":null},{"id":"04056532-6172-46c5-af20-b1ccb917d599","body":"Draft PR #95 is ready as the next tested checkpoint: https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/95 at `8a809208eb87d60575282290dfdd59a681fae676`, stacked on #94. Frozen install, all repository tests (57 lint cases), full verification and build passed. The durable receipt records scope, the caught fixture-admission regression, cleanup proof and remaining limits. Nothing is merged or deployed. I have continued on the next branch for API/test boundary migration; the end-to-end DEV-73 then DEV-74–81 goal remains active.","attachments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-04T03:44:41.232Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-04T03:44:40.992Z","parentId":null,"resolvedAt":null,"quotedText":null,"author":{"id":"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df","name":"Cooper Corbett"},"onBehalfOf":null},{"id":"5e6499d3-7614-441f-a586-d79b544e77ea","body":"Continuing the approved implementation goal. PR #94's hosted Quality workflow passed: https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/actions/runs/37173655454. The next slice migrates the four real-command Oxlint suites to Bun-hosted @effect/vitest, scoped Effect filesystem/process resources and a new type-check gate. All 52 prior cases plus 3 cleanup cases passed; cleanup covers success, failure and interruption. All eleven canonical rules now cover the directly owned lint TypeScript files, and four obsolete Bun adapter admissions are removed. A repository fixture-path regression found during migration was fixed without weakening the negative assertions. Final root tests and verification are running; no completion claim yet. DEV-73 remains In Progress, and the Medicare result change remains separately pending. No merge, deployment or provider apply has occurred.","attachments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-04T03:39:54.867Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-04T03:39:54.803Z","parentId":null,"resolvedAt":null,"quotedText":null,"author":{"id":"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df","name":"Cooper Corbett"},"onBehalfOf":null},{"id":"755becc6-fd92-474a-b3c4-c2687a0f20f7","body":"[Draft PR #94](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/94), commit `c8affdc99f5eb155cec1af7793ef8cb8f2feb4cc`, replaces 370 owned native traversals and enables five canonical rules globally. Actual CLI fixtures cover web source, JavaScript tooling and root config; domain packages retain all eleven rules. Repository tests, full verification/build, 23 portable rule cases, 15 governance tests, three evaluation tests and type checks passed. Real local workerd proof passed SSR/assets/404/client navigation with zero diagnostics after detecting and correcting a browser-serialized callback import failure. That original DOM projection is explicitly pending host migration; no broad exemption was added. Final lint/format/docs checks passed after the correction. PR #93 hosted Quality passed. Next: repository-integrated Bun-hosted @effect/vitest tooling tests, then the remaining six policy families and semantic audits. End-to-end goal remains active; no merge/deployment or Medicare result change.","attachments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-04T03:20:36.980Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-04T03:20:36.939Z","parentId":null,"resolvedAt":null,"quotedText":null,"author":{"id":"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df","name":"Cooper Corbett"},"onBehalfOf":null},{"id":"287d4b96-610b-4577-9cd4-4533121f028c","body":"[Draft PR #93](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/93), commit `0b58ab5`, enables all eleven canonical strict rules for core/rules/calculators, consolidates date Schema validation, closes direct DateInterval admission of empty/reversed intervals, and replaces raw report/error JSON in boundary tests. All repository tests, 16 core tests, 17 actual CLI fixture cases, full verification and build passed. Tests assert admitted file count, exit code and the ten applicable domain diagnostics; web-runtime naming remains with web scope. Diagnostic compatibility change is recorded in a core Changeset. Persistent end-to-end goal is committed in the active plan. Continuing remaining owned collections and host workflow migration; no tax-result correction, merge or deployment.","attachments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-04T02:52:53.856Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-04T02:52:53.818Z","parentId":null,"resolvedAt":null,"quotedText":null,"author":{"id":"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df","name":"Cooper Corbett"},"onBehalfOf":null},{"id":"757246f0-2b53-4a3c-99a4-7f4fb51127e7","body":"Cooper explicitly confirmed the end-to-end implementation goal: finish DEV-73's enforced dependency/Effect and host proof gates, then DEV-74–81 through tested, reviewable draft PRs. This runtime exposes no native goal capability; the active repository continuation plan and task plan now record that goal. Draft PRs are checkpoints, not terminal completion. Recent shell execution and full verification succeeded. Continuing domain boundary enforcement and then remaining owned host/tool/app paths. Medicare result changes remain gated on the recorded decision; that does not block independent work. No merge/deployment authority added. PR #92 hosted Quality passed: https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/actions/runs/37171497508/job/111345177224","attachments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-04T02:46:03.331Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-04T02:46:03.277Z","parentId":null,"resolvedAt":null,"quotedText":null,"author":{"id":"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df","name":"Cooper Corbett"},"onBehalfOf":null},{"id":"436e9ba6-e19c-4f68-b686-d64f3a6eeae4","body":"[Draft PR #92](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/92), commit `e7b9f0a5a1da09fbc22825ce5916f0ba1d2aac7a`, adds immutable graph construction, Match-based Medicare branching, Effect collection traversal and canonical immutable-collection lint enforcement across core/rules/calculators including tests. Full local verification, all repository tests (46 Oxlint tests plus retained calculator goldens), build, type checks and frozen install passed. No tax parameters, formulas, snapshots or results changed. PR #91 hosted Quality passed at [run 37170984499](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/actions/runs/37170984499). Remaining: complete strict rules and all owned paths before DEV-74 acceptance. Medicare correction still awaits the separate material scope decision. No merge/deployment/publication.","attachments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-04T02:35:55.469Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-04T02:35:55.422Z","parentId":null,"resolvedAt":null,"quotedText":null,"author":{"id":"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df","name":"Cooper Corbett"},"onBehalfOf":null},{"id":"7785d60b-aaf2-4bf4-863f-30b1278de84e","body":"Repository-integrated Atom qualification is committed at `8549b92` in draft [PR #91](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/91), stacked on #90. Full local `bun run verification` passed, including both Chromium lifecycle tests; frozen install and web type checks passed. Exact Scheduler peer patch, retained warning and recovery are documented. No app runtime or tax result changes. PR #90 hosted Quality passed. Execution remains available after the reported disconnect: a shell check and completed verification process both returned successfully. Continuing strict-policy migration; DEV-73 remains In Progress, not complete, merged or deployed.","attachments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-04T02:25:38.077Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-04T02:25:38.044Z","parentId":null,"resolvedAt":null,"quotedText":null,"author":{"id":"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df","name":"Cooper Corbett"},"onBehalfOf":null},{"id":"db7b8f4f-c061-4e79-b12a-4cecd54be0e1","body":"**Decision brief for Cooper — bounded Medicare correction (no source changes applied).**\n\nVerified **enacted** law: Treasury Laws Amendment (Delivering an Efficient and Trusted Tax System) Act 2026, No. 58, [official as-made text](https://www.legislation.gov.au/C2026A00058/asmade/2026-06-30/text/original/epub/OEBPS/document_1/document_1.html). Royal Assent: **30 June 2026**. Section 2 commencement table item 4: Schedule 5 commenced **1 July 2026**. Schedule 5 item 14 explicitly applies to **2025–26 and later income-year assessments**. These are enacted amendments, not Budget proposals.\n\nFor the supported single, non-SAPTO individual scope, items 3 and 5 change the nil threshold **$27,222 → $28,011** and phase-in ceiling **$34,027 → $35,013**. Rates remain 10% shade-in and 2% full levy. TaxKit supports only 2025–26 for its public annual calculator; this correction would not introduce another supported year, family calculations, SAPTO or surcharge support.\n\nDirectly affected: `au.income-tax.annual`, including its SDK/API results, traces and source provenance. The pay take-home and PAYG-withholdings calculators use their separate Schedule 1 parameter/rule packs, not this annual Medicare table; the bounded correction should preserve those outputs and retain regression tests for both.\n\n**Tested impact:** executed the actual current annual rules with only a hypothetical table Layer replacing the two thresholds; production source/results remain untouched. At $30,000 taxable income: levy **$277.80 → $198.90**, annual liability **$1,465.80 → $1,386.90** (−$78.90). At $28,011: levy $78.90 → $0. At $35,013: $700.26 → $700.20 under retained cent rounding. At $20,000, $50,000 and $80,000, levy/liability are unchanged. This is a what-if rule execution, not an adopted correction.\n\n**Recommendation:** authorise a separate, source-backed correction limited to the annual 2025–26 single non-SAPTO Medicare table, with a newly retrieved/checksummed legal source artifact, exact lower/upper boundary and unchanged-range tests, annual golden-result updates, report/source trace evidence, Changeset and explicit adad requalification. Keep all other tax parameters/calculators and historical evidence unchanged. No merge or deploy authority is needed to prepare that correction; approval is needed only because it changes the explicitly retained-result scope.\n\nIndependent DEV-73 implementation continues. PR #90 Quality has now passed.","attachments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-04T02:10:56.232Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-04T02:10:56.174Z","parentId":null,"resolvedAt":null,"quotedText":null,"author":{"id":"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df","name":"Cooper Corbett"},"onBehalfOf":null},{"id":"0c39a091-3ed0-465b-8b94-62e9b62cfa51","body":"Canonical skills slice committed at [`b726afb556fcafdb929b41417a8b0cf4a4aec92c`](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/b726afb556fcafdb929b41417a8b0cf4a4aec92c), reviewable in [draft PR #90](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/90), stacked on #89. Complete nine-skill trees, two TaxKit overlays, eleven relative Claude links and governance rejection tests are implemented. Full local verification, 15 governance tests, 21 skill tests, docs/runbooks and package-skill validation passed. Hosted Quality for #90 is ru…11635 tokens truncated…exercise external or exact consumer paths.
